  "factor_name": "Trailing-sign adaptive tail-resilience asymmetry",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "sign(prior_126d_mean_cross_sectional_IC) * rolling_mean_5((sum_30_positive_returns - sum_30_negative_return_magnitudes) / (sum_30_positive_returns + sum_30_negative_return_magnitudes)).shift(1)",
    "description": "Computes a 30-day upside-versus-downside movement asymmetry, smooths it over five observations, lags it one day, and adaptively reverses its cross-sectional direction only when the trailing 126-observation mean cross-sectional 10-day IC is negative. The direction estimate uses only information available before the signal date."
  },
